<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>상품 리스트 - 앨트웰 모바일 쇼핑몰</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/2025/css/index.css?ver=032">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/2025/css/main.css?ver=032">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/2025/css/product_list.css?ver=031">
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <!--#include virtual="/2025/components/top_navi.asp" -->
    <div class="main_contents">
        <div class="category_navi">
            <div class="back_btn"><img src="/2025/images/icon/arrow_left.png"/></div>
            <p>누벨마리</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub_category_navi">
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">전체</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">누벨마리 핑크</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">누벨마리 블랙</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">일반 보정</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">노블</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">누벨마리 me</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">누벨마리 레드로얄</div>
            <div class="sub_cate_btn">코어벨</div>
        </div>
        <div class="pr_list_box">
            <div class="list_counter">
                총 10개
            </div>
            <div class="pr_list">
                <div class="pr_thumbnail">
                    <img src="/2025/images/sample/thumbnail_sample_03.gif"/>
                </div>
                <div class="pr_name">
                    코어벨
                </div>
                <div class="member_price">
                    누벨마리 오픈버스트 바디슈츠(그린)
                </div>
                <div class="sale_price">
                    <span>500,000</span><span>원</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ep_price">
                    400,000
                </div>
                <div class="pr_option">
                    <div class="option_select_box">
                        <div class="select_text">
                            사이즈
                        </div>
                        <div class="select_btn">
                            ▼
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pr_num_box">
                        <div class="minus_btn">-</div>
                        <div class="pr_num">
                            <span>999</span><span>개</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="plus_btn">+</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pr_cart"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="pr_list">
                <div class="pr_thumbnail">
                    <img src="/2025/images/sample/thumbnail_sample_03.gif"/>
                </div>
                <div class="pr_name">
                    코어벨
                </div>
                <div class="member_price">
                    누벨마리 오픈버스트 바디슈츠(그린)
                </div>
                <div class="sale_price">
                    <span>500,000</span><span>원</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ep_price">
                    400,000
                </div>
                <div class="pr_option">
                    <div class="option_select_box">
                        <div class="select_text">
                            사이즈
                        </div>
                        <div class="select_btn">
                            ▼
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pr_num_box">
                        <div class="minus_btn">-</div>
                        <div class="pr_num">
                            <span>999</span><span>개</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="plus_btn">+</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pr_cart"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!--#include virtual="/2025/components/bottom_navi.asp" -->
</div>
<script src="/2025/js/script.js?ver=032"></script>
</body>
</html>